## Trap notes (this session)

- esbuild bundles the BUILT dist of workspace packages: edit src → `npx tsc -b` (package) → `pnpm run bundle` (packages/agentide) → restart gateway. Stale dist cost an hour.
- Kill gateways by PID from `ss -ltnp | grep -oE 'pid=[0-9]+'` — `pkill -f bin.bundled` doesn't match.
- `handleTransportRequest`'s catch swallows transport exceptions → -32603 with zero logs; instrument THAT catch first when MCP misbehaves.
- Tokens expire in 1h.
- adapter-mcp tests: `pnpm exec vitest run packages/adapter-mcp/src/__tests__/` from repo root (44/44).

